A||||5||GT Bastard||Where can I find obscure cd's online?||||1||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||07-25-2000||07:50 PM||||I'm having a helluva time trying to find a band called Lush Life.  They're sorta electronic, ambient, jazzy stuff.... I'm positive they're called Lush Life, but I'm having no luck.  Anybody know of a good place online?  I've tried cdnow.com with no luck.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Coconut||07-25-2000||08:34 PM||||GTB,<P>I'll ask Kristina to post when she gets home. She has been able to locate CD's of stuff that isn't available on CD here in the U.S. Lots of old albums I had back in the 70's that I never even dreamed I could get on CD. The only catch is it may be an Import so it'll probably cost substantialy more. But if it's something you absolutely have to have, she might be able to help out!<P>Cruisin' On, <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroGTGirl||07-25-2000||09:45 PM||||GT Bastard~~<P>Ok.  I have a pretty big list of sites that I search for those hard to find CD's.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.musicsearch.com" TARGET=_blank>www.musicsearch.com</A>   (you can use their "meta music search" option which is good at locating different websites that have that band on them)<P>Believe it or not I have found Obscure CD's at Amazon.com.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.songsearch.com" TARGET=_blank>www.songsearch.com</A>   (they also have alot of Obscure CD's)<P>And the rest of the sites I have found (and Yes I do search them all)<BR> <A HREF="http://www.cduniverse.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cduniverse.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.cdworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cdworld.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.towerrecords.com" TARGET=_blank>www.towerrecords.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.thewherehouse.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thewherehouse.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.ktel.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ktel.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.cdconnection.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cdconnection.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.totale.com" TARGET=_blank>www.totale.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.borders.com" TARGET=_blank>www.borders.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.getmusic.com" TARGET=_blank>www.getmusic.com</A> <P>Hopefully you will find it!  The other place you can check out, as a last resort, is Ebay.  My experience with Ebay CD's is they are over priced. <P>Good luck!<P>Kristina<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroGTGirl_sig5.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||07-26-2000||12:19 AM||||A quick search turned this up:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.cdnow.com/cgi-bin/mserver/SID=228050438/pagename=/RP/CDN/FIND/album.html/artistid=BOWERY+ELECTRIC/itemid=1156765" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cdnow.com/cgi-bin/mserver/SID=228050438/pagename=/RP/CDN/FIND/album.html/artistid=BOWERY+ELECTRIC/itemid=1156765</A> <P>the album name is Lushlife, and it's the same kind of music.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
